   206-208., Budapest, Hungary.
   1.5. "Licensee" means the individual or Legal Entity that accepts
   this License by downloading, installing, or using the Software.
   "You" and "Your" refer to the Licensee. If You accept this License
   on behalf of a Legal Entity, You confirm that You are authorized to
   do so, and the Licensee is that Legal Entity. Use of the Software by
   or on behalf of a Legal Entity is use by that Legal Entity.
   1.6. "Legal Entity" means any company, partnership, association,
   foundation, cooperative, public body, or other organization, and any
   individual acting in the course of a trade, business, or profession.
   1.7. "Organization" means the Licensee together with every Legal
   Entity that directly or indirectly controls the Licensee, is
   controlled by the Licensee, or is under common control with the
   Licensee, that is, the whole group: parent companies, subsidiaries,
   and companies under common control (each such Legal Entity other
   than the Licensee an "Affiliate"). "Control" means owning more than
